OL,4,BThe art of protection - inside an F1   
OL,5,Bhelmet factory                         
OL,6,GAs soft, instrumental opera music      
OL,7,Gplays in the background of a precise   
OL,8,Gtemperature-controlled room in         
OL,9,Gnorthern Italy, Thomaso is using a     
OL,10,Gchildren's toy ball and hairdryer to   
OL,11,Gperform his meticulous work.           
OL,13,FHugely focused, in a crisp white coat, 
OL,14,Fhe moulds a precious sticky black      
OL,15,Fmaterial over and over again for up to 
OL,16,Fsix hours.                             
OL,18,FOne day, his fastidiousness may save   
OL,19,Fthe life of one of the best athletes   
OL,20,Fin the world.                          
